        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Puritans</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Where</span><span class="info-stat-val"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/england">England</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/wales">Wales</a>, with ties to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/scotland">Scotland</a> and the Continental Reformed churches; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/new-england">New England</a>, above all the Massachusetts Bay Colony, Plymouth Colony, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/connecticut-river">Connecticut River</a> colonies and Providence Plantations</span></div>
